{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-teller-semantic.md","title":"一致强Kleene固定点中的真理陈述者","display":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 一致强Kleene固定点中的真理陈述者","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","aliases":["91-df-truth-teller-semantic","91-df-truth-teller-analysis"],"display":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 一致强Kleene固定点中的真理陈述者","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller]]","[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-teller-semantic</span><span>91-df-truth-teller-analysis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 一致强Kleene固定点中的真理陈述者"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b350e567d372da0\" href=\"?note=6b350e567d372da0\" title=\"91-df-unstable-sentence\">91-df-unstable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-teller-semantic-—-一致强-Kleene-固定点中的真理陈述者-$\\mathrm{TellSem}$\">df-truth-teller-semantic — 一致强 Kleene 固定点中的真理陈述者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TellSem}\">\\(\\mathrm{TellSem}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n的真理陈述者)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (标准强 Kleene 跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (从空信息得到的最小固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\)</span> (信息一致的固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma\">\\(v_\\Gamma\\)</span> (固定点诱导的三值评估)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TellSem}_{J_{\\mathrm{SK}}}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\land\nv_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\n\\bigl(\nv_{\\Gamma_1}(\\tau)\\ne v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\tau)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TellSem}_{J_{\\mathrm{SK}}}(\\tau)\n\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\land\nv_{\\Gamma_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\n\\bigl(\nv_{\\Gamma_1}(\\tau)\\ne v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\tau)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小构造没有独立根据接受 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\tau\">\\(\\neg\\tau\\)</span>，所以把它留为间隙。\n兼容的非空初始信息可产生判 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 真或判它假的一致固定点；因此\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是固定点选择依赖的典型，而不是“在同一序列中必然振荡”的句子。</p>\n<p>与之相反，标准说谎者\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n在一致强 Kleene 固定点中保持间隙。若把含真值过剩的信息固定点也纳入，\n该稳定性结论可能失效，所以断言必须使用\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\)</span> 而不是未加限制的全部代数固定点。</p>\n<p>在修正语义中，真理陈述者通常保持其初始经典值；这又是另一种\n“依赖初始假设”，不应与固定点间的不稳定性或说谎者的后继阶段振荡混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-teller-semantic-—-一致强-Kleene-固定点中的真理陈述者-$\\mathrm{TellSem}$","text":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 一致强 Kleene 固定点中的真理陈述者 $\\mathrm{TellSem}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-unstable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"6b350e567d372da0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-4","target